<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-25T08:56:13.968Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:56:13 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have struck Saudi targets, hitting a finance centre and a tower in the capital, wounding several people including Indian nationals. The Saudi-led coalition intercepted Houthi drones and missiles over the Red Sea and in western Yemen, and hit a Houthi arms depot east of Taiz. Saudi civil defence reported that 11 people were injured in the tower drone strike. New Delhi condemned the attack on the tower. 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOc1BiYksyaDNtYjZFcEktR3ZVR3loMUVjbzNMN3hNOUhZRHZjTXFmQVZCMjRzVHY3aGFjcFd3bUNGTWJNTU1jYktLOHRUSjdfbUpNUlFVa0JfTDk0NnBndW1ucHNnd0R6ZEZYWVI3SnNoOVlaendaY0s4ODJkbFlnSExDajZVMlRfX0Q3OGcyY3A3R2ZwRkxuNmtQM2h2YWdhRnlOVjdVNzdQandSeENEelpjdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxOb2dTWUpPVTVVZXE2QUVrQTRXcEtOM05qNFlpRXhWQVBpR0h0aDRUREdVdjlaNTRRS0hGR2dIYnVxWlZicU1ZTEFvMlpoZl9GZ2tvaVpxb3J1bkhNSHQ1NDJFcTNMZGpSbXNkQVJZNTNSNlliUnhvenlPOWk1bUsxNWJ1eHk5UHZXTkRwUFpKcXNwdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQdjZVLVU3RnVMWXdvYUpUUkdTcVVCTjVvdkR1NG12eUNYalM5bTJVbVFndmFEZ2d1UGhUeEROM2lMcTRuMHBQQmh6amtpaWJIc0k1aHdBMEZvRUNEUndCYWJZZnIxS0x0OFNuRmgxMl90VEZKVVVwZVB2d0swTmpyQjdaejluSXRVeGNrVEMzU21zMkhIT21uSWNvM0cza1RYdkFDeW9OdVNIdGhtcW1PRTJmUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
